Source: rebuntu-live
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Rebuntu Project <rebuntu@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: rebuntu-live
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sudo
Description: Rebuntu live session support
 Provides the deterministic live user, a sane live-media sudo policy and a
 serial-console TTY for the Rebuntu live (casper) environment. This is a
 live-image component: it creates the throwaway "live" user used on the
 medium and is not part of the installed-system package set.